# Attribution for the vendored JOG runtime

`JOG.min.js` in this directory is an unmodified copy of the JOG V2 runtime.

- Project: JOG (JavaScript Object GUI)
- Source: https://github.com/jjanuszczak/jog
- Version: 2.0.0 (reported by `JOG.min.js`)
- Source commit: 118d2be72f2368cff40bacdc1ca39b3f1dd6670a
- License: MIT (see `LICENSE` in this directory)

Vendoring keeps `hs web` self-contained instead of loading the runtime from a
CDN. See `docs/web-interface-plan.md` for the decision record. When updating
this file, copy the matching `LICENSE` from the same upstream commit and refresh
the version and commit above.